  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Legal support and legal rights training for student activists and union leaders</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to strengthen the protection of student and labour union activists. The project will offer legal support and emergency legal services in cases brought against individuals, as well as providing rights literacy trainings, conducting strategic impact litigation, and publishing newsletters and press statements. The Programme aims to improve capacity, knowledge and understanding on topics relating to inclusion, especially sexual orientation and gender equality.</narrative>
  </description>
